{"t":"Route:Femor Hills","s":"route-femor-hills-abd1f","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Femor_Hills_Underground_7cc904.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills\">Femor Hills</a> have very many <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a> as many Tibians know. But not every Tibian knows that there are also very dangerous monsters like hunters and demon skeletons, that is why in this article you can find escape routes, normal routes and Monster <a href=\"#/wiki/Respawn\">spawns</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Equipment_needed:\">Equipment needed:</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<p>Only on some routes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Be_prepared_to_face:\">Be prepared to face:</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Sheep\">Black Sheep</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps:\">Maps:</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Femor Hills Underground\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Femor_Hills_Underground_7cc904.gif\" width=\"269\"/></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Femor Hills Ground\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"397\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Femor_Hills_Ground_ccf4fe.gif\" width=\"422\"/></span>\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> <i>At the letter </i>B<i> is a hole and there are rumours talking about a goblin house with <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a> guarding a ring and an amulet.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Femor Hills 1 up\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"361\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Femor_Hills_1_up_b9f2bb.gif\" width=\"357\"/></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Femor Hills top\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"482\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Femor_Hills_top_ce4390.gif\" width=\"418\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also:\">See also:</span></h2>\n<p>Traveling<br/>\nRings<br/>\nAmulets<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a>\n</p></div>","quests":[]}